{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10370","headline":"登广陵栖灵寺塔 · 高适","name":"登广陵栖灵寺塔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"淮南富登临，兹塔信奇最。\n直上造云族，凭虚纳天籁。\n迥然碧海西，独立飞鸟外。\n始知高兴尽，适与赏心会。\n连山黯吴门，乔木吞楚塞。\n城池满窗下，物象归掌内。\n远思驻江帆，暮时结春霭。\n轩车疑蠢动，造化资大块。\n何必了无身，然後知所退。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10370.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10370","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}